# llm-wiki — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

This folder is your project's knowledge layer. The agent reads from here; you write to here (via slash commands, not by hand).

## What lives where

```
<wiki root>/             ← llm-wiki/ inside a project, or the notebook folder in a vault
├── README.md            ← you are here
├── _INDEX.md            ← every entry in the wiki (auto-generated)
├── wiki/                ← THIS PROJECT's entries
│   ├── HOME.md          ← landing page
│   ├── _MAP.md          ← always-loaded orientation map (auto-generated)
│   └── <folders>/       ← the folders chosen at scaffold time (listed below)
├── raw/                 ← the sources, verbatim (articles, transcripts, PDFs); append-only
├── _inbox/              ← work in progress: the queue, staged entries, reports (created on first use)
└── _signals/            ← truth-status sidecars written by /wiki-verify (created on first use)
```

